  m_Text: "You will not have any assistance now while searching for the objects.
    \n\nThe red dot seen below will be in the middle of the screen; it is used as
    a cursor to indicate where you should position your head to select the objects
    if the white outline does not apppear. \n\nPress the trigger to continue..."
